c-text\">Linux 大页分配方式 - Huge Translation Lookaside Buffer Page (hugetlbfs)</span></a></li><li class=\"toc-item toc-level-3\"><a class=\"toc-link\" href=\"#Linux-%E5%A4%A7%E9%A1%B5%E5%88%86%E9%85%8D%E6%96%B9%E5%BC%8F-Transparent-Huge-Pages-THP\"><span class=\"toc-text\">Linux 大页分配方式 - Transparent Huge Pages (THP)</span></a></li><li class=\"toc-item toc-level-3\"><a class=\"toc-link\" href=\"#JVM-%E5%A4%A7%E9%A1%B5%E5%88%86%E9%85%8D%E7%9B%B8%E5%85%B3%E5%8F%82%E6%95%B0%E4%B8%8E%E6%9C%BA%E5%88%B6\"><span class=\"toc-text\">JVM 大页分配相关参数与机制</span></a></li></ol></li><li class=\"toc-item toc-level-2\"><a class=\"toc-link\" href=\"#JVM%E5%86%85%E5%AD%98%E7%94%B3%E8%AF%B7%E4%B8%8E%E5%88%86%E9%85%8D%E6%9C%BA%E5%88%B6%E5%88%86%E6%9E%90\"><span class=\"toc-text\">JVM内存申请与分配机制分析</span></a><ol class=\"toc-child\"><li class=\"toc-item toc-level-3\"><a class=\"toc-link\" href=\"#%E5%86%85%E5%AD%98%E7%AE%A1%E7%90%86%E7%9A%84%E5%A4%9A%E7%BA%A7%E5%B1%82%E6%AC%A1\"><span class=\"toc-text\">内存管理的多级层次</span></a></li><li class=\"toc-item toc-level-3\"><a class=\"toc-link\" href=\"#%E5%86%85%E5%AD%98%E7%9B%91%E6%8E%A7%E4%B8%8E%E5%B7%AE%E5%BC%82\"><span class=\"toc-text\">内存监控与差异</span></a></li><li class=\"toc-item toc-level-3\"><a class=\"toc-link\" href=\"#%E5%86%85%E5%AD%98%E7%9B%91%E6%8E%A7%E7%9A%84%E6%9C%80%E4%BD%B3%E5%AE%9E%E8%B7%B5\"><span class=\"toc-text\">内存监控的最佳实践</span></a></li></ol></li></ol>","author":{"name":"WU LEI","slug":"blog-author","avatar":"/images/avatar.jpg","link":"/","description":"Code & Life <br> 道阻且长，行则将至","socials":{"github":"https://github.com/taeyang0126","twitter":"","stackoverflow":"","wechat":"","qq":"","weibo":"","zhihu":"","csdn":"","juejin":"","customs":{}}},"mapped":true,"hidden":false,"prev_post":{"title":"JVM内存解析 - 3.Java堆内存相关设计","uid":"9640d66face2dd0a065876de54a4a8d5","slug":"jvm/内存解析/JVM内存解析-Java堆内存相关设计","date":"2025-03-01T17:46:30.000Z","updated":"2025-03-23T17:30:30.000Z","comments":true,"path":"api/articles/jvm/内存解析/JVM内存解析-Java堆内存相关设计.json","ke